'''Type of Feat''': [[General]]

'''Prerequisite''': [[Base Attack Bonus]] 6, [[Point Blank Shot]], [[Pinpoint accuracy]], [[Weapon Focus]] ([[ranged weapon]])

'''Specifics''': When you make an attack using [[pinpoint accuracy]], you sacrifice your additional attacks. You deal an additional 1d4 damage per iterative attack (e.g., with 3 attacks, you deal +2d4 damage). Taking this feat a second time, increases the damage to +1d6 instead of +1d4.

'''Use''': Selected

==Notes==
*Added in the [[PRC Expansion Pack]].

